// Hash Puzzle: Proof of Knowledge
//
// Anyone who knows the secret preimage of a hash can spend this output.
// No signature required - just knowledge of the secret.
//
// This pattern is used in:
//   - Hash Time-Locked Contracts (HTLCs)
//   - Atomic swaps
//   - Payment channels
//
// Initial stack:
//   <secret>
//
// To solve: find a value whose SHA256 matches the hash below.
// For this example, the secret is the number 42.
// Set initial stack to: 42
//
// Click "Verify" to cross-check against Rúnar's ScriptVM!

// Hash the secret
sha256

// Push the expected hash, which the script creator computed in advance:
// SHA256 of the script encoding of 42, which is the single byte 0x2a
0x684888c0ebb17f374298b65ee2807526c066094c701bcc7ebbe1c1095f494fc1

// Check if hashes match. The stack is left holding that one answer.
equal
